                                                                <string key="text">Photo Dance Party!  Press the iTunes Music button to choose music from your iTunes Library.  Press the Photos button to choose photos from your Photos Library or the Camera button to take a photo.  Press the Go button and watch YOUR PICTURES fly around each other and create chaos!  Let the Photo Dance Party Begin!</string>
