                                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                                <string key="userLabel">Choose photos from your library or take pictures with your camera.  Then Press the Play button and your photos will be in the game.  Flick a fireball at your photos and watch them break up into little pieces, or watch your photos hit each other and do crazy things!</string>
